### TITLE ###
set then get
### SET greeting hello ###
### RESULT ###
created
### GET greeting ###
### RESULT ###
hello
### FINAL ###
greeting = hello

### TITLE ###
setting an existing key reports what it replaced
### SET k first ###
### RESULT ###
created
### SET k second ###
### RESULT ###
replaced "first"
### GET k ###
### RESULT ###
second
### FINAL ###
k = second

### TITLE ###
deleting a missing key is not an error
### DEL nothing ###
### RESULT ###
no such key
### FINAL ###
(empty)

### TITLE ###
a block action carries a multi-line value
### SET_BLOCK poem ###
roses are red
violets are blue
### RESULT ###
created
### GET poem ###
### RESULT ###
roses are red
violets are blue
### FINAL ###
poem = roses are red
violets are blue

### TITLE ###
a longer session
### SET a 1 ###
### RESULT ###
created
### SET b 2 ###
### RESULT ###
created
### DEL a ###
### RESULT ###
deleted
### GET a ###
### RESULT ###
<missing>
### FINAL ###
b = 2
